<view class="staff-page has-foot"><view class="content"><include src="/templates/subject.wxml" /><view class="notice notice-warn"><text class="ico">!</text><view >护理员只记录异常描述，定级处置由兽医完成。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">异常基本信息</text><text class="card-sub">自动关联</text></view><view class="form-row"><view class="form-label req">关联订单</view><view class="form-field"><view class="select" bindtap="toastMsg" data-msg="该项由订单自动带出，不可修改">{{d.orderNo}} · {{d.petName}} <text class="ico">›</text></view></view></view><view class="form-row"><view class="form-label ro">宠物名称</view><view class="form-field"><view class="ro-value">{{d.petName}}（订单自动关联）</view></view></view><view class="form-row"><view class="form-label ro">房号</view><view class="form-field"><view class="ro-value">B-108（订单自动关联）</view></view></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">异常类型</text><text class="section-extra">单选</text></view><view class="card"><view class="choice-grid c4"><view class="choice-card {{form.abtype==='皮肤'?'on':''}}" bindtap="pick" data-field="abtype" data-value="皮肤" data-clear-alert="1"><text >皮肤</text></view><view class="choice-card {{form.abtype==='食欲'?'on':''}}" bindtap="pick" data-field="abtype" data-value="食欲" data-clear-alert="1"><text >食欲</text></view><view class="choice-card {{form.abtype==='行为'?'on':''}}" bindtap="pick" data-field="abtype" data-value="行为" data-clear-alert="1"><text >行为</text></view><view class="choice-card {{form.abtype==='其他'?'on':''}}" bindtap="pick" data-field="abtype" data-value="其他" data-clear-alert="1"><text >其他</text></view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">异常描述</text><text class="tag tag-orange">必填</text></view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.f1}}" placeholder="请描述观察到的异常现象" bindinput="onField" data-field="f1"></textarea><view class="hint">请客观描述观察到的异常情况，不填写医疗诊断或处置结论</view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">现场照片</text><text class="section-extra">最多上传 6 张</text></view><view class="card"><view class="photo-grid"><view class="photo filled" wx:for="{{photos.p1.items}}" wx:key="uid" bindtap="previewPhoto" data-key="p1" data-url="{{item.url}}"><image wx:if="{{item.url}}" class="photo-img" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill" /><text wx:else class="photo-mark">爪</text><text class="photo-badge" wx:if="{{item.badge}}">{{item.badge}}</text><text class="photo-wm">{{item.wm}}</text><text class="photo-del" catchtap="removePhoto" data-key="p1" data-index="{{index}}">×</text></view><view class="photo photo-add" bindtap="choosePhoto" data-key="p1"><text class="ico">▣</text><text>拍照 / 上传</text></view></view><view class="hint">支持现场拍摄与点击预览，照片自动附加拍摄时间</view></view><view class="card"><view class="kv"><text class="k">提交后状态</text><text class="v"><text class="tag tag-gray">待定级</text></text></view><view class="t11 muted">上报后进入兽医待复核队列，护理员不参与定级、诊断与处置。</view></view></view><view class="footer"><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{readOnly||submitting}}" loading="{{submitting}}">提交上报</button></view></view>